---
description: Release Squish Pocket to test before any official promotion
alwaysApply: true
---

- Follow the project-wide `AGENTS.md` and `RELEASING.md`.
- Work in the single GitHub checkout; the old SquishPocket path is an alias.
- Routine fixes and new features go to `squish-test.chemisgreat.online` first.
- `npm run deploy` and `npm run deploy:test` target test only.
- Promote the official game only when the user explicitly requests it, using
  `npm run deploy:production -- --tested-version ID` for the verified candidate.
- Preserve separate test/official databases, rooms, and browser saves.
